  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sun & Sand for 6 | New 6 Seater Golf Cart and New Bikes <br><br>Truly home away from home. Introducing, Sun and Sand for 6 at Prominence on 30A. Thoughtful touches throughout this home give way to the nostalgic charm of a classic beach cottage. This inviting 2-bedroom, 2-bath townhouse in Prominence features family-friendly perks, brand-new bikes and beach gear, and the convenience of beach access just 5 minutes away. <br><br>Home Layout ~ <br>- Garage and bike access downstairs<br>- Main living space upstairs <br>- Open concept Living Room, Dining Room, and Kitchen<br>- Primary bedroom and Guest Bedroom<br>- Washer & Dryer <br><br>Features to Love ~ <br>- NEW 6 Seater Golf Cart<br>- Family- friendly comforts > highchair, booster seat, and pack n play available for your little one <br>- Furry friends are welcome too > pet bowl and mat provided plus easy access to walking paths. <br>- 4 new bikes available to cruise The Timpoochee Trail that runs along 30A. <br>- Caffeine lovers unite! Complimentary coffee with both a standard and Keurig provided. <br>- Kitchen is fully stocked with everything you need to create the perfect post-beach snack! <br>- Large dining table with seating for 6, plus 3 additional at the island. <br>- Cozy and comfy vibes fill the living room, inviting the family to gather for a movie night.<br>- 2 Resort-style pools. The Northside pool (3 min walk) has zero entry and seasonally heated as well. <br><br>More Included in your Stay ~ <br>- Starter kit for everything you'll need: paper towels, toilet paper, linens, towels, dish soap, laundry pods, etc. <br>- Premium bath essentials: All bathrooms come fully equipped with full-size Public Goods body wash, shampoo, conditioner, hand soap, and lotion. <br>- Complimentary beach gear: beach wagon, umbrella, 6 chairs, and beach towels provided. <br>- Sound machine in every room, great for peaceful nights after long beach days. <br>- Washer/dryer in unit<br><br>For Rest ~ <br>- Primary bedroom: King bed, smart TV, ensuite with double vanity + walk-in shower<br>- Guest bedroom: King bed + smart TV. Shared full hallway bathroom. <br>- Living Room: Pull out Queen Sofa bed <br><br>The Neighborhood ~ <br>The Big Chill: A fantastic spot for family gatherings, offering free entertainment like movies and concerts on the green, a variety of restaurants, and plenty of outdoor space to relax. It's an ideal choice for unwinding after a day at the beach.<br><br>Beach, Beach, Beach!<br>Grab your bikes (or take a drive) and in just 5 minutes, you'll be sinking your toes into the sand at Deer Lake Beach Access. Plus, there are 3 other beach access points close by for easy beach-hopping fun. You've got the beach, we've got the gear! We provide beach wagon, chairs, umbrellas, and beach towels. <br><br>You're also centrally located with Rosemary and Alys to the East - just 10-15 mins via bike, or you're a golf cart ride away to Seaside to the West. You're in the middle of it all that 30A has to offer! <br><br>Prominence also features 2 resort style pools! The Northside pool is seasonally heated (Oct/Nov + Mar/April) and offers zero-entry (perfect for kids). The pool also features loungers, umbrellas, grills and dining, plus a locker room and restroom. The Southside pool features cabanas and loungers as well! <br><br>⭐️ NEW ⭐️ Fun perks now available for Kalos' guests. Now offering, 20% off all Sculpt Studio classes at the Big Chill. Contact us for details! <br><br>To Note: <br> - Parking is available in the driveway for 1 vehicle at the townhome directly in front of the garage door (Unit C) There is no street parking available but there is overflow parking in South Prominence. <br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25.<br>- We love our furry friends, and they need a vacation too! We allow dogs that are under 30 lbs and non- shedding. If your pup fits that criteria, we'd love for you to bring them along. A one-time, non-refundable pet fee of $250 will be added to your reservation. Thank you for understanding!<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi or construction on 30A. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters.<br><br>This home is proudly managed by Kalos Dwellings. Please reach out if we can answer any questions for you! 💛 <br><br>STR25-219166",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "☀️ Sun & Sand for 6! NEW 6 Seater Golf Cart | Heated Pool | 4 Bikes 🚲"
        }
      ],
